hadiths[50]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3720","It was narrated from Zaid bin Thabit that the Prophet said:""'Umra (a gift given for life) belongs to the heir"
"3721","It was narrated from Zaid bin Thabit that the Messenger of Allah said:""'Umra (a gift given for life) belongs to the heir"
"3722","It was narrated from Zaid bin Thabit that the Prophet ruled that 'Umra (a gift given for life) belongs to the heir"
"3723","It was narrated that Zaid bin Thabit said:The Messenger of Allah said: ""Whoever gives a life-long gift"
"3724","It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin 'Abbas that the Prophet said:""'Umra is permissible"
"3725","It was narrated from Ibn 'Abbas that the Prophet said:""Indeed 'Umra is permissible"
"3726","It was narrated from Tawus that the Messenger of Allah made 'Umra and Ruqba binding"
"3727","Malik bin Dinar narrated from 'Ata'"
"3728","Abdul-Karim narrated from 'Ata'"
"3729","Shu'bah said:""I heard Qatadah narrating from 'Ata'"
"3730","Abdul-Malik bin Abi Sulaiman narrated from 'Ata' who said:""The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever is given something for the rest of his life"
"3731","Sufyan narrated from Ibn Juraij"
"3732","Ibn Juraij narrated from 'Ata':""Habib bin Abi Thabit informed us from Ibn 'Umar"
"3733","Ibn Juraij said:'Ata' informed me"
"3734","Yazid bin Ziyad bin Abi Al-Ja'd narrated from Habib bin Abi Thabit"
"3735","Ibn Juraij said:""Abu Az-Zubair informed me that he heard Jabir saying: 'The Messenger of Allah said: ""Whoever is given something on the basis of 'Umra it belongs to him for the rest of his life and after he dies"
"3736","Al-Hajjaj bin As-Sawwaf narrated from Abu Az-Zubair"
"3737","Hisham narrated from Abu Az-Zubair"
"3738","Khalid narrated from Dawud bin Abi Hind"
"3739","Hushaim narrated from Dawud"
"3740","Al-Awza'i narrated from Az-Zuhri"
"3741","(A different chain) from Abu 'Amr"
"3742","(A different chain) from Al-Awza'i"
"3743","It was narrated from Hisham bin 'Urwah"
"3744","Al-Laith narrated from Ibn Shihab"
"3745","Malik narrated from Ibn Shihab"
"3746","Shua'ib narrated from Az-Zuhri"
"3747","Ibn Abi Dhi'b narrated from Ibn Shihab"
"3748","Salih narrated from Ibn Shihab"
"3749","Yazid bin Abi Habib narrated from Ibn Shihab"
"3750","Hisham said:""Yahya bin Abi Kathir narrated to us"
"3751","Abu Isma'il said:""Yahya narrated to us that Abu Salamah narrated to him"
"3752","Isma'il narrated from Muhammad"
"3753","Muhammad bin 'Amr said:""Abu Salamah narrated to us"
"3754","Bashir bin Nahik narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Prophet said:""A lifelong gift ('Umra) is permissible"
"3755","It was narrated that Qatadah said:""Sulaiman bin Hisham asked me about a lifelong gift. I said: 'Muhammad bin Sirin narrated that Shuraih said: ""The Prophet of Allah ruled that a lifelong gift is permissible.""'"" Qatadah said: ""I said: 'And An-Nadr bin Anas narrated to me"
"3756","It was narrated from 'Amr bin Shu'aib"
"3757","It was narrated from 'Amr bin Shu'aib"
"3758","It was narrated that 'Abdur-Rahman bin 'Alqamah Ath-Thaqafi said:""The delegation of Thaqif came to the Messenger of Allah"
"3759","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Messenger of Allah said:""I was thinking of not accepting gifts except from a Quraishi"
"3760","It was narrated from Anas that some meat was brought to the Messenger of Allah and he said:""What is this?"" It was said: ""It was given in charity to Barirah."" He said: ""It is charity for her and a gift for us"
"3761","It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:""The oath by which the Messenger of Allah used to swear was: 'No"
"3762","It was narrated from Salim that his father said:""The oath by which the Messenger of Allah used to swear was: 'No"
"3763","It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Messenger of Allah said:""When Allah created Paradise and Hell"
"3764","It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:""The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever swears"
"3765","Yahya bin Abi Ishaq said:""A man from Banu Ghifar told me"
"3766","It was narrated from Salim"
"3767","It was narrated from 'Umar that the Prophet said:""Allah forbids you to swear by your forefathers."" 'Umar said: ""By Allah"
"3768","It was narrated from Salim"
"3769","It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:""The Messenger of Allah said: 'Do not swear by your fathers"